/Title (Systemic Risk and Flash Crashes Our Future Forecast analysis revealed a divergence where Deep Learning models predicted a sharp correction while linear models predicted stability. If deployed at scale, automated sell-orders triggered simultaneously by similar algorithms could amplify a minor dip into a "Flash Crash," as seen in the 2010 US market crash. The recursive nature of RNNs creates a feedback loop that can destabilize market liquidity during stress periods. )
